message: >-
  These are the final v1.0.0 stable source bytes dated 2026-08-21. Cite the
  tagged release once available. The exact staged-source commit and checksums
  are recorded in release-manifest.json; a null manifest tag means the source
  has not yet been tagged or published.
title: "AI Research Tech Tree"
type: dataset
authors:
