abstract: >-
  A stable, evidence-linked research atlas of artificial-intelligence
  developments, open research directions, landmark works, and explicitly
  typed relationships, presented through Timeline, Network, Opportunity, and
  List views with machine-readable knowledge-graph exports.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - history of artificial intelligence
  - research atlas
  - knowledge graph
  - technology tree
  - research methods
